// Shared by every crystal shader (crystal_clear glass + ice, crystal_milky quartz, crystal_diamond; Tier 0 and the Tier 1
// hero variants). Task 67 / P4, spec .orchestra/tasks/63/looks/spec.md section 5.
//
// Where the masks sit (contract C2, same three uniforms as rock.gdshader):
//   batch_local = 1: CUSTOM0.xyz  (the stone's own coordinate + its anchor; StoneBatch, node-drawn lone stones)
//   local_pos   = 1: the model-space VERTEX (the item panel's copy, which spins the stone)
//   neither        : the world position (boulders, material() / fresh_material())
// so the flaws / bubbles / hackle ripples stick to the stone while it is carried, falls or breaks.
//
// The game's environment has REFLECTION_SOURCE_DISABLED (a matt low-poly look), so the built-in sky reflection is off:
// every crystal reflects and refracts its OWN baked 64x64x6 world cube (CrystalLook.world_cube()), stored as
// sqrt(linear / 4) in RGBA8 (decode: c * c * 4).
// Flat facets: the face normal comes from the screen derivatives, as in rock.gdshader (each facet reflects the sun on
// its own: free glitter).

uniform float fresh = 0.0;              // 1: a fresh break face (conchoidal hackle ripple, rougher, frost)
